Third-party components
======================

Ultralytics YOLOv8 (https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics), AGPL-3.0.
  Used for training and ONNX export (optional `train` extra). The released model weights
  (vest_specialist.onnx, vest_specialist.int8.onnx) are derived from a YOLOv8n model and are therefore
  distributed under AGPL-3.0; the ONNX files carry that licence in their metadata.

ONNX Runtime (MIT), OpenVINO (Apache-2.0), OpenCV (Apache-2.0), NumPy (BSD-3-Clause),
PyYAML (MIT), PySide6 / Qt for Python (LGPL-3.0), FastAPI (MIT), Streamlit (Apache-2.0).
  Installed as dependencies; not redistributed in this repository.


Training data
=============

Datasets from Roboflow Universe, used under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 as stated by their
publishers. No dataset images are redistributed in this repository. See ATTRIBUTION.md for the list,
links, and one licence that has not been independently verified.


